	)
	(text "U9 supplies: A = Teensy 3.3 V; B = RF 3.3 V. OE tied to VCCA.\nEither rail off: U9 outputs Hi-Z. Common ground.\n100k pulls define MCU idle and deassert RTS / CTS."
		(at 20.32 173.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.143 1.143)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a86f3882-300b-4cfa-b152-31ebd90a2882")
	)
	(text "C52 / 47 pF closest to VCC. Ripple goal <=50 mV p-p. UART115200.\nRP-SMA: XB3-24AST-J + A24-HASM-450.\nUSB adapter assumed at ground station.\nSpecify SoC Rev C+; inspect label per Digi p101."
		(at 20.32 186.69 0)
